{"4139980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Magical Hellhound Lust", "steam_appid": 4139980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4565310], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical Hellhound Lust is a rogue-lite dungeon crawler that combines endless replayability and player builds, complex characters and storytelling, and all hand-drawn visuals, set in an original high fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RECLAIM YOUR PAST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle the succubi Sisterhood, topple their armies and reclaim the source of all magic that they wrongfully took from you. The succubi stole the Black Fire, and must pay the price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139980/extras/26234257ebff5d2a48bf42b72bd63568.avif?t=1785431372\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139980/extras_big/26234257ebff5d2a48bf42b72bd63568.webp?t=1785431372 width=1560 height=712 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER GODLY POWERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge the Black Fire with your weapon and body. Use one of its three aspects, Sun, Moon and Ash, to empower yourself. Incarnate each aspect to drastically alter gameplay. Supercharge your weapon, your body and your armor. Craft the ultimate build and become the goddess of magic anew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPLAY ENDLESSLY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine the Sun, Moon and Ash aspects together in all three of your forms and unlock endless possible builds. Mix and match to your preference, focusing on agility, brute power or devastating spells. Play in the campaign with your handcrafted build, or go full rogue-like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139980/extras/7157091974e4b072e9c972442800565c.poster.avif?t=1785431372\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139980/extras/7157091974e4b072e9c972442800565c.webm?t=1785431372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139980/extras/7157091974e4b072e9c972442800565c.mp4?t=1785431372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TACKLE IMPOSSIBLE CHALLENGES (if you want)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of additional challenges await. Go for them one at a time, or combine them for brutally enhanced difficulty and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD WORTHY RELATIONSHIPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an elaborate world with deep characters, nothing is black or white, nor is perfect. Chat with your friends and enemies alike. Let them teach you valuable skills and listen to their stories. Make difficult decisions, doing what you think is best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY TOGETHER IN AN ASYMMETRIC ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a friend with you to help on your journey with old school couch co-op, or Remote Play Together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HANDCRAFTED WITH LOVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indulge in our handcrafted world with first-rate pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical Hellhound Lust is a rogue-lite dungeon crawler that combines endless replayability and player builds, complex characters and storytelling, and all hand-drawn visuals, set in an original high fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RECLAIM YOUR PAST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle the succubi Sisterhood, topple their armies and reclaim the source of all magic that they wrongfully took from you. The succubi stole the Black Fire, and must pay the price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139980/extras/26234257ebff5d2a48bf42b72bd63568.avif?t=1785431372\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139980/extras_big/26234257ebff5d2a48bf42b72bd63568.webp?t=1785431372 width=1560 height=712 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER GODLY POWERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge the Black Fire with your weapon and body. Use one of its three aspects, Sun, Moon and Ash, to empower yourself. Incarnate each aspect to drastically alter gameplay. Supercharge your weapon, your body and your armor. Craft the ultimate build and become the goddess of magic anew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPLAY ENDLESSLY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine the Sun, Moon and Ash aspects together in all three of your forms and unlock endless possible builds. Mix and match to your preference, focusing on agility, brute power or devastating spells. Play in the campaign with your handcrafted build, or go full rogue-like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139980/extras/7157091974e4b072e9c972442800565c.poster.avif?t=1785431372\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139980/extras/7157091974e4b072e9c972442800565c.webm?t=1785431372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139980/extras/7157091974e4b072e9c972442800565c.mp4?t=1785431372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TACKLE IMPOSSIBLE CHALLENGES (if you want)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of additional challenges await. Go for them one at a time, or combine them for brutally enhanced difficulty and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD WORTHY RELATIONSHIPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an elaborate world with deep characters, nothing is black or white, nor is perfect. Chat with your friends and enemies alike. Let them teach you valuable skills and listen to their stories. Make difficult decisions, doing what you think is best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY TOGETHER IN AN ASYMMETRIC ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a friend with you to help on your journey with old school couch co-op, or Remote Play Together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HANDCRAFTED WITH LOVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indulge in our handcrafted world with first-rate pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Hack, slash and crush the succubi armies as the Magebane. Discover your true nature and reclaim your power in this vibrant, action-packed, rogue-lite ARPG. Enact vengeance with agile slashes, crushing hammer blows, chaotic magic, or combine all three styles to attain true godhood.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139980/a443be8e74d404edbaef1d9e559e5d1873a08bae/header.jpg?t=1785431372", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139980/0d2b8a4d57c76a09de273de10e8c79ed5942ac5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785431372", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139980/0d2b8a4d57c76a09de273de10e8c79ed5942ac5f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785431372", "website": "https://www.mildaponno.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 